        <profile name="Engine of Destruction" id="5f90-f03d-bfcd-1394" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model fights, if it is equipped with both a warpstrike claw and a reaper chainsword (including any Relic that replaces such a weapon), and if it made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, then until that fight is resolved, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this model.</characteristic>
