          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this model is reduced to 0 wounds, roll 2D6 before removing it from play. If either of the dice are a 6, it explodes, and each unit within 2D6&quot; suffers D6 mortal wounds (if both the dice are a 6, each unit within 3D6&quot; suffers D6 mortal wounds instead).</characteristic>
