            <profile name="Protection Protocols" id="a17e-69c8-6ce7-e392" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst this model is within 6&quot; of any friendly &lt;QUESTOR TRAITORIS&gt; TITANIC models, it can perform a Heroic Intervention as if it were a CHARACTER. When doing so, this model is eligible to perform a Heroic Intervention if it is within 6&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically of any enemy unit. Each time this model makes a Heroic Intervention move, it can move up to 6&quot; instead of 3&quot;. All other rules for Heroic Interventions still apply.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="War Dog Moirax 2 (4-6 wounds remaining)" id="c5bf-f9fa-7522-665b" hidden="false" typeId="800f-21d0-4387-c943" typeName="Unit">
