          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Select one daemonbreath meltagun, twin daemonbreath meltagun, daemonbreath spear or daemonbreath thermal cannon that model is equipped with.
- That weapon is now a Relic for all rules purposes.
- Delete that weapon&apos;s abilities.
