          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of each of your Shooting phases, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of the bearer. Until the end of the turn, each time a ranged attack is made by the bearer against that unit, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</characteristic>
