            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle round, when a saving throw is made for the bearer is failed, you can use this Relic. When you do, the Damage characteristic of that attack is changed to 0. Each time this Relic is used, roll 2D6. If the result is equal to or greater than the bearer&apos;s Leadership characteristic, this Relic cannot be used again during the battle.</characteristic>
