              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- This WARLORD can ignore any or all modifiers to their characteristics profile (the only exceptions are characteristics changes incurred as a result of Damage suffered, as shown on this WARLORD&apos;s datasheet.
- Each time this WARLORD makes an attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to its hit rolls, wound rolls or damage rolls.
