              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Standard" typeId="8415-27e8-bbac-4ee6">Each time a ranged attack is made against the bearer, on an unmodified saving throw of 6, the attacking model&apos;s unit suffers 1 mortal wound after all of the unit&apos;s attacks have been resolved (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds).</characteristic>
